arc-rebar is a free utility, made to help people get the most out of their graphics
cards. It currently supports Intel Arc cards, and support for other vendors is being
tested. It is free for personal use. It may not be modified, rebranded, sold or
redistributed without the author's written permission. Some editions or features may
be offered under separate terms; where they are, those terms apply.

